-## Downstream Contract Work
+The server records its own receipt time; the client does not supply an authoritative timestamp. Validation occurs before acceptance: the worker must be authenticated, field types must be valid, the plot UUID must resolve in the catalog (active or archived, so historical corrections remain possible), and a non-null base revision must identify a revision of the same visit. A submission naming a revision of another visit, or an unknown revision, is rejected.
 
